{'symbol': 'AXON', 'date': '2023-05-17 07:30:00', 'title': "SAN BERNARDINO COUNTY DISTRICT ATTORNEY'S OFFICE DEPLOYS AXON JUSTICE PREMIER", 'text': "SAN BERNARDINO COUNTY IN CALIFORNIA ADOPTS AXON'S DIGITAL EVIDENCE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM DESIGNED SPECIFICALLY FOR PROSECUTORS AND CRIMINAL DEFENSE LAWYERS SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ. , MAY 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 AXON (NASDAQ: AXON ), THE GLOBAL PUBLIC SAFETY TECHNOLOGY LEADER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE SAN BERNARDINO COUNTY DISTRICT ATTORNEY'S OFFICE SIGNED A 10-YEAR CONTRACT FOR AXON JUSTICE PREMIER \xa0TO MANAGE THEIR DIGITAL EVIDENCE."}